msgid "⟪k:0⟫That tale would have been far easier on you, I’m sure."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그게―― 훨씬 ⟪k:1⟫마음 편하지 않겠는지요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E7DB052E_DAD7_459E_BC56_0801A835C943
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a14d31cc1c1b77eb106c12632d86fbbabe5432b743502547c00811d1568e32a
