msgstr "⟪k:0⟫네, ⟪k:1⟫인종이 말이지요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_3DEB76D0_C400_41A6_86CB_AADC4D54BC79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 81089d7a3cb8aa96131c66e185894872d4a485f615891d7794f93d02fc63456c
