"⟪k:0⟫But was that the only reason?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Would that be enough for him to mistake her for a "
"beast?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫그게 다일까요? ⟪k:2⟫겨우 그거 가지고 ⟪k:3⟫짐승으로 착각할 수가 있을까요?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_9C5A2C33_8B58_4458_8D69_BF0232B854AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e0603661cb8d27a3d63c78d77a65ffda308537903302e4a02fe696cc61ad1096
