msgid "⟪k:0⟫I have my own theory—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫his memories may have played a role."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫저는 ⟪k:1⟫이렇게 추측한답니다. ⟪k:2⟫이 점에는 베스티아의―― ⟪k:3⟫기억도 관계가 있는 건 아닐지"
"요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2946D2EC_E581_45DF_9D8B_B7A09205D04B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e66d833a74c1ed04af035bf9e7e07f81be15b1fc93461593bce2f95faf05d61
#. default-sha256: 5ee3f12e380711976e9b1a9f3346f8424f663751aae26d77a79218a16d490ca2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2946D2EC_E581_45DF_9D8B_B7A09205D04B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I suspect Bestia was afraid the memories from when he was “human” would cause him to waver."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫베스티아는―― ⟪k:1⟫본인의 「사람」일 적 기억을 자극받기 싫은 것 아니었을까요?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_98F60F19_0750_4D1D_92B7_3425D74D193D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f56529af7a7e70d64288d24ade585d9ccf47245ce75f9354507c87b24792db1
