msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that is simply my own speculation.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Perhaps he had merely lost his grip on "
"reality."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫네…… 이건 ⟪k:1⟫제 추측에 불과합니다. ⟪k:2⟫베스티아는 ⟪k:3⟫진작에 미친 걸 수도 있지요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_0B5A92AD_EA04_4094_81EE_93FFE9E10F0A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4beec83d20ed498615fe78c87a78575ba0d168db0d2995f4a19eef08ce88c4c4
#. default-sha256: 2655ec077646f01bf47406db1001cfdf6ac018c3ab603da8e1c4fc94bbd73f1e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0B5A92AD_EA04_4094_81EE_93FFE9E10F0A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How well have you come to understand Bestia, Master?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫주인님께선 ⟪k:1⟫베스티아를―― 얼마나 파악하셨는지요?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_0B679438_AE79_44E5_BE4C_4CB4E204C918
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4a8682a06ba0be1932fcaf8963b7a9de4d95384dfbdab03d91f0735df6c834b2
