msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You ⟪k:1⟫do⟪k:2⟫ appear to think he was an ordinary human who believed himself to be a beast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫베스티아는 ⟪k:1⟫본인이 짐승인 줄 아는 그냥 사람……. ⟪k:2⟫이렇게 ⟪k:3⟫파악하셨을 것 같은데요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CF588D14_E9C6_434D_A3A6_CCAD57B87EFE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e19b876c874bcd92efd3f58913745f46539a6fa30763408d9193fb6c106195a8
