msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CF588D14_E9C6_434D_A3A6_CCAD57B87EFE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But where... ⟪k:1⟫does the line between man and beast truly lie?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만…… ⟪k:1⟫사람과 짐승의 경계란 ⟪k:2⟫과연 어디에 있을까요?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3FD44329_FA98_4D23_9759_54C51EFC9104
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0927242f23b91c78fc01e581dba20905bc18572fb29808ffc8ed306d52cfc852
#. default-sha256: 67e3d49e4d17788d74ba112f10a303ceda163f8ac7733998c8a63830372dad78
