msgid "⟪k:0⟫That I do not know."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저는 헤아릴 수조차 없겠습니다……."

#: scenario2:scenario2_DA791398_946B_4073_A5E2_43A80A4225D3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c71ae3fba7542d42f4b6fa23f0a84cd2a22b954414540115e14edd7f9e83d0ca
